# Vercel Hobby caps a deployment at 12 serverless functions. Disha's live slice
# only needs /api/disha; the rest of the teaching engine (video, RAG, lessons,
# documents, speech, progress, profile) needs a real browser + ffmpeg + a
# persistent disk that serverless doesn't provide, so it isn't deployed here.
# All of it still runs locally (npm run dev). Excluding the route files keeps
# the function count under the limit.
app/api/video
app/api/teach
app/api/documents
app/api/rag
app/api/speech
app/api/profile
app/api/progress
app/api/health
